{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102313","id":2311054810,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Jv-Xa","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102313","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102313.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102313.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102313","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102313/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102313/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102313/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/08343189dc89678bfbb108c78ae923b66d5949af","number":102313,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Rework scene preview thumbnails (reverted)","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nSupersedes #102263\r\nWill need to disable code from #96544 because of conflict\r\n\r\nMake scene files (.glb, gltf, .tscn, .scn) to always generate missing/outdated thumbnails, captures in a fixed angle, and fits all visual elements into the image, operation is done on a separate thread. Respects environment settings at ```rendering/environment/defaults/default_clear_color```.\r\n\r\nThis PR also fixes preview image caching, when testing, **file has to be changed to generate a new thumbnail.**  (md5 != last_md5) \r\n\r\n\r\n# Caveats\r\n1. Loses the ability to capture custom thumbnails with view. Open and save a scene still result in fixed view thumbnails, but as discussed in #102263, I think it would be better to implement custom thumbnails in another better approach.\r\n\r\n2. If scene has particle with large bounding box, preview camera will be set far away because of it. Meshes might be small in view. This is done intentionally, to accommodate scenes that are basically particle effects.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b46ed441-28a9-4031-b43b-926a274c56b0)\r\n\r\n# 3D\r\nCamera will always point at world center, dolly out at 3/4 view angle, until all contents fit into screen.\r\nFor particles, fast-forwards them it to (lifetime * 0.5)  in order to render something, with fixed seed.\r\n\r\nPractical:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13f8d3ee-31a5-46f6-9acc-673fdd8f48e0)\r\n\r\nProduction:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4b2b10c-897e-49ab-8b78-c39931efc521)\r\n\r\n# 2D\r\nRender in two passes, 2D and GUI, then combines 2D + GUI captures for the final thumbnail image. \r\n\r\nDoes **NOT** account the world center for 2D capture, this decision is made because the use case that will benefit most from scene thumbnails are prefabs, which normally don't care about world coordinates, thus dedicating more pixels to actual contents.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9912bd54-6361-4fc9-9832-8a220b0f5cb3)\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n - [x] Generate scene thumbnails on file create/rename/save/duplicate/import\r\n - [x] Only apply preview lighting to scenes that have 0 light nodes\r\n - [x] Prevent tool scripts from running when generating thumbnails\r\n - [x] Support for 2d scenes (Scenes with 0 Node3D count)\r\n - [x] Make thumbnail creation thread-safe\r\n - [x] Do proper cache validation at ```editor_resource_preview.cpp``` to prevent outdated thumbnails\r\n\r\nTest projects:\r\n[rework_scene_thumbnails_test_proj.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19721611/rework_scene_thumbnails_test_proj.zip)\r\n\r\n[junk_files.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20516654/junk_files.zip)\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>DEV NOTES</summary>\r\n\r\n - Rip off scripts by using ```SceneState::get_bundled_scene()``` and ```SceneState::set_bundled_scene()``` to change the data of PackedScene before instantiating it.\r\n - In ```editor_resource_preview.cpp```, suspect cache validation is somewhat wrong within these lines, will return early with a outdated thumbnail image:\r\n    - line 276-281\r\n    - line 305-307\r\n    - line 488-491\r\n\r\n - Need to disable the old ```EditorNode::_save_scene_with_preview``` for this PR\r\n - Will result in outdated thumbnail if user quickly (save->edit->save) a scene within ~0.5 seconds, this should not happen, is there something wrong with how ```EditorResourcePreview::queue``` is managed?\r\n - Control anchors do not play well with Camera2D, thus 2d scene thumbnail need to be rendered twice (gui + node2d)\r\n - It might be possible to draw viewport texture outside of the tree using ```RenderingServer::viewport_create()``` with ```EditorResourcePreviewGenerator::draw_requester.request_and_wait()```, also being thread safe.\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n___\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7232.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","